# UI Hub (Sanitized)

Public snapshot summarizing the hub interface without exposing restricted player flows.

## Overview
- Describes shared hub widgets and their modular event lifecycle.
- Highlights integration with inventory previews and narrative callouts.
- Maintains compatibility with the global UI framework.

## Sanitized Notes
- Specific faction routing, unlock conditions, and telemetry hooks have been excised.
- Private diagrams covering social features and live service integrations remain internal only.
- For full flow coverage, reference the secured UX repository.
